  {
    "episode_id": 90651,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90651.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "Well, one thing's for sure, you're probably the first person on our show, including us that's ever had a compliment. So we'll take it. But looking ahead, entering a new Democratic administration with President-elect Biden, what are your priorities for legislation for our K-12 public school systems across the country once we move beyond obviously this period of crisis that we're in?",
