        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker values positive feedback and sees it as meaningful.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "K-12 public education is a legitimate and important domain for federal legislative action.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The ongoing crisis will eventually subside, allowing focus on long-term policy planning.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The interviewee possesses relevant expertise or insight into K-12 educational policy.",
