      {
        "text": "Congressional inaction on key bills reflects political obstruction rather than lack of merit.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The success of integration is primarily measured by academic performance and reduced achievement gaps.",
        "confidence": 0.88
